Polymake -- a package for interfacing with polymake
***************************************************

Description
===========

Polymake is a package for interfacing with polymake, and for reading and
writing files in polymake's format.


Warning: this package is not complete, and is mostly undocumented, but it is
used in *note gfanInterface: (gfanInterface)Top,. It is expected that the
interface will change in the (near) future.

Author
======

  * Josephine Yu (see http://www.math.mit.edu/~jyu/ ) <jyu@math.mit.edu>

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 0.1 of Polymake, released March 21, 2008.

